# Read Spec Before Coding

Before editing ANY signal in `signals.py`:
→ Read `specs/signals.md` section for that signal (params, data, expected direction)

Before editing `data_layer.py`:
→ Read `specs/data-layer.md` in full

Before editing `backtest_runner.py`:
→ Read `specs/backtest-engine.md` in full

CRITICAL: The immutable functions in data_layer.py are:
- `evaluate_sharpe()` — NEVER modify
- `compute_buy_and_hold()` — NEVER modify

These are the ground-truth metrics. Modifying them invalidates all comparisons.
